  "description": "The Tout Terrain Vasco 28 Select 6.3 is a versatile and durable steel frame gravel bike built to handle everything from long gravel rides to multi-week bikepacking trips. This latest Select model achieves the perfect balance between agility and durability, making it easier than ever to seek out adventure.\n\nDrivetrain: Equipped with a reliable Shimano GRX 1x12 drivetrain, featuring a wide-range 11-51T Sunrace cassette for steep climbs and high speeds.\n\nFrame & Fork: Built with a rugged Vasco steel frame (Tout Terrain Stratocrom tubing) and paired with a durable Tout Terrain Expedition steel fork for comfort and resilience.\n\nIntegrated Power: Ready for long-distance touring with a Shutter Precision PL-7 hub dynamo and the Cinq Plug Pure 7 power supply for charging electronics on the go.\n\nTire Clearance: Rolls on fast 28\" wheels with Continental Terra Trail 700Cx45mm tires on DT Swiss G540 rims, offering reliable grip on mixed terrain.\n\nMounting Points: Ample capacity for gear with 4 bottle cage mounts on the frame and 2 on the fork, plus mounting points for mudguards and a Racktime Viewit rear rack.\n\nThe Vasco 28 Select 6.3 is available in sizes S, M, L, XL, with a maximum total weight capacity of 130 kg.\n\nS M L\n\nA SEAT TUBE LENGTH (mm) 490 530 570 610\n\nA1 SEAT TUBE LENGTH (mm) 431 471 512 552\n\nB TOP TUBE LENGTH (mm) 535 555 575 595\n\nC HEAD TUBE LENTH (mm) 125 150 175 200\n\nD CHAINSTAY LENGTH (mm) 435 435 440 440\n\nE WHEELBASE (mm) 1010 1030 1045 1060\n\nF BOTTOM BRACKET DROP (mm) 70 70 70 70\n\nG HEAD TUBE ANGLE (*) 71 71 71.5 71.5\n\nH SEAT TUBE ANGLE (*) 73 73 72.5 72\n\nI STACK (mm) 562 585 611 635\n\nJ REACH (mm) 363 376 382 389\n\nK STAND OVER CLEARANCE (mm) 766 797 829 859",
